# SoundPlant demo: hyperpop, 160 BPM, G# minor. Factory sounds only: tools/make_demos.py puts it on the emulator page.
# A hyperpop song in G# minor. One four-bar hook (G#m | E | B | F#, with one wrong note, an A natural) comes back transformed:
# a music box alone, in thirds on a super-saw lead, reharmonised over B major in the break, slowed to a ballad.
# T1 kit (808 kick, layered claps, tuned toms)  T2 knit round sub bass  T3 rayon fm brass stabs  T4 jacquard nasal lead
# T5 jacquard digi pluck (arp)  T6 jacquard vowel pad (the texture)  T7 rayon toy keys (the music box)  T8 voile vocal chop
# Song: intro 8, glitch verse 16, pre 8, drop 20, music-box break 12, pre 2 4, drop 2 24 (+2 semitones), ballad outro 12.
bpm 160
knob 9 e1 0
knob 9 e2 8
knob 9 e3 1

# ---- the sounds
# T1 the kit: an 808 kick tuned to G#1 with a long tail, a snare with a clap layered on it, tuned toms (G#2, D#3), crushed in the verses
knob 1 d1.k1 86
knob 1 d1.k2 74
knob 1 d1.k3 100
knob 1 d1.k4 62
knob 1 d1.drive 40
knob 1 d1.volume 84
knob 1 d2.k1 92
knob 1 d2.k2 56
knob 1 d2.k3 112
knob 1 d2.k4 100
knob 1 d2.volume 86
knob 1 d2.send2 36
knob 1 d3.k1 112
knob 1 d3.k2 26
knob 1 d3.k3 100
knob 1 d3.k4 30
knob 1 d3.volume 68
knob 1 d4.k1 112
knob 1 d4.k2 70
knob 1 d4.k3 100
knob 1 d4.k4 30
knob 1 d4.volume 62
knob 1 d5.k4 64
knob 1 d5.volume 88
knob 1 d5.send2 44
knob 1 d6.k1 54
knob 1 d6.k2 90
knob 1 d6.volume 92
knob 1 d6.send2 30
knob 1 d7.k1 83
knob 1 d7.k2 80
knob 1 d7.volume 90
knob 1 d7.send2 30
knob 1 d9.volume 40
knob 1 d10.k1 89
knob 1 d10.volume 56
knob 1 d10.send1 30
knob 1 d11.k1 93
knob 1 d11.volume 54
knob 1 d11.send1 24
knob 1 cut 8
knob 1 res 70
knob 1 fenv 70
knob 1 ctype crush
knob 1 camt 60
knob 1 ctone 90
knob 1 cmix 0
knob 1 level 76
# T2 a knit round sub: mono, driven, ducked by the kick
preset 2 round_sub knit
param 2 oct 2
knob 2 brain 2
knob 2 cut 66
knob 2 ctype drive
knob 2 camt 80
knob 2 ctone 92
knob 2 cmix 110
knob 2 ltype pump
knob 2 lspeed track_1
knob 2 lamt 50
knob 2 level 92
# T3 a rayon fm brass: short chord stabs on the offbeats
preset 3 fm_brass rayon
param 3 oct 2
knob 3 brain 2
knob 3 level 100
knob 3 pan 32
knob 3 send1 16
knob 3 send2 22
# T4 a jacquard nasal lead, polyphonic so the hook plays in thirds
preset 4 nasal_lead jacquard
param 4 oct 2
knob 4 vmode poly
knob 4 brain 2
knob 4 level 110
knob 4 pan 64
knob 4 send1 26
knob 4 send2 22
# T5 a jacquard digi pluck through the arp player: sixteenth plucks
preset 5 digi_pluck jacquard
param 5 oct 2
knob 5 brain 2
knob 5 player arp
knob 5 p1 1/16
knob 5 p2 up
knob 5 p3 2
knob 5 ap1 short
knob 5 ap4 wide
knob 5 level 90
knob 5 pan 116
knob 5 send1 36
knob 5 send2 20
# T6 a jacquard vowel pad: the texture, high and shimmering in the drops, the bed under the break and the vocal pad of the outro
preset 6 vowel_pad jacquard
param 6 oct 2
knob 6 brain 2
knob 6 level 84
knob 6 pan 12
knob 6 send2 52
# T7 a rayon toy keys: the music box
preset 7 toy_keys rayon
param 7 oct 2
knob 7 brain 2
knob 7 level 104
knob 7 pan 116
knob 7 send1 34
knob 7 send2 56
# T8 a voile vocal chop
preset 8 vocal_chop voile
param 8 oct 2
knob 8 brain 2
knob 8 level 100
knob 8 pan 96
knob 8 send1 40
knob 8 send2 30
# FX I a dotted-eighth echo, FX II a bright hall
knob 11 engine delay
knob 11 e1 108
knob 11 e3 50
knob 11 e4 46
knob 12 engine hall
knob 12 e2 78
knob 12 e3 54
mst lo 62
mst hi 62
mst comp 58
mst pump 22
mst pumpby kick
mst release 68
mst level 104

