# ---- scenes and the song: the mask is T1..T8, COND, THROW; x = muted
# intro A: the hook on a music box, alone
scenedef 1 1 1 1 1 1 1 1 4 1 1
scenemute 1 xxxxxx.x..
# intro B: the hook again with a pad, a tick of hats and a held ah
scenedef 2 1 1 1 1 1 1 2 4 1 8
scenemute 2 .xxxx.....
# verse A: the beat stutters, crushed, the sub in its holes
scenedef 3 2 1 1 1 1 1 3 1 1 2
scenemute 3 ..xxx..x..
# verse B: the same stutter, the vocal chop
scenedef 4 2 1 1 1 1 1 3 1 1 3
scenemute 4 ..xxx.....
# verse C: the heavier stutter, plucks on the arp
scenedef 5 3 1 1 1 1 1 3 2 1 2
scenemute 5 ..xx......
# verse D: the lead teases the hook, the kit builds
scenedef 6 3 1 1 4 1 1 3 2 1 4
scenemute 6 ..x.......
# pre A: kit doubling, the pitch rising
scenedef 7 4 2 1 1 4 2 3 2 1 5
scenemute 7 ..x...xx..
# pre B: everything closing in
scenedef 8 4 2 1 1 4 2 3 2 1 6
scenemute 8 ......x...
# drop A: the hook in thirds, G#m | E | B | F#
scenedef 9 5 3 2 2 2 3 4 3 1 8
scenemute 9 ......x...
# drop B: the hook up an octave, the music box glitching over it
scenedef 10 6 4 3 3 3 3 4 3 1 8
scenemute 10 ..........
# drop A again, the bells joining, a fuller arp
scenedef 11 5 4 3 2 3 3 4 3 1 8
scenemute 11 ..........
# drop B again, the turnaround fill
scenedef 12 6 4 3 3 3 3 4 3 1 2
scenemute 12 ..........
# drop tag: the lead alone with the kit, then the echo
scenedef 13 6 4 2 2 1 3 4 3 1 8
scenemute 13 ....x.x...
# break A: the hook on the music box over B major, a pad beneath
scenedef 14 1 1 1 1 1 4 1 4 1 1
scenemute 14 xxxxx.....
# break B: the sub drone, the vowel under the box
scenedef 15 1 5 1 1 1 4 1 4 1 1
scenemute 15 x.xxx.....
# break C: the snare rolls up, the riser starts
scenedef 16 7 5 1 1 1 4 1 4 1 6
scenemute 16 ..x.x..x..
# pre 2: the climb again, and the last bar goes silent
scenedef 17 4 2 1 1 4 2 3 2 1 7
scenemute 17 ......xx..
# outro A: the hook at half speed, G#m then E, the kit in half-time
scenedef 24 8 6 4 5 1 5 5 5 1 1
scenemute 24 ..x.x.....
# outro B: B then F#, the wrong note held
scenedef 25 8 7 4 6 1 6 6 6 1 1
scenemute 25 ..x.x.....
# outro C: the A resolved, B major, a music box
scenedef 26 1 8 4 1 1 7 7 7 1 8
scenemute 26 x.xxx.....
knob 9 e3 9
# drop 2 A, two semitones up
scenedef 18 5 3 2 2 2 3 4 3 2 8
scenemute 18 ......x...
# drop 2 B: the music box plays the hook over the lead
scenedef 19 6 4 3 3 3 3 1 3 2 8
scenemute 19 ..........
# drop 2 A with the bells
scenedef 20 5 4 3 2 3 3 4 3 2 8
scenemute 20 ..........
# drop 2 B with the turnaround
scenedef 21 6 4 3 3 3 3 4 3 2 2
scenemute 21 ..........
# drop 2 last time round, the box on the hook again
scenedef 22 6 4 3 3 3 3 1 3 2 1
scenemute 22 ..........
# drop 2 tag: the lead alone, then the echo
scenedef 23 6 4 2 2 1 3 4 3 2 8
scenemute 23 ....x.x...
knob 9 e3 1
song 1:4 2:4 3:4 4:4 5:4 6:4 7:4 8:4 9:4 10:4 11:4 12:4 13:4 14:4 15:4 16:4 17:4 18:4 19:4 20:4 21:4 22:4 23:4 24:4 25:4 26:4
songloop 0
expect lanes <65

# ---- play the song (HOME, SELECT to the Song page, PLAY)
tap HOME
turn SELECT 1
stats reset
wav soundplant_demo_hyperpop.wav
tap PLAY
bars 104
wait 3000
wavstop
stats
